  data: {
    LLM: "Save your high cards (Aces/Kings) for the end. Winning the last trick is crucial. Don't waste an Ace early on a trick worth nothing.\n\nCounting Suits: Since the deck is small, knowing when a suit is exhausted is easy. Lead a long suit to force opponents to discard their high cards in other suits.\n\nThe 'Spar' Bluff: Pretend to be weak to induce a lead, then slam your Ace down on the last trick.",
    Player: "Save your high cards (Aces/Kings) for the end. Winning the last trick is crucial. Don't waste an Ace early on a trick worth nothing.\n\nCounting Suits: Since the deck is small, knowing when a suit is exhausted is easy. Lead a long suit to force opponents to discard their high cards in other suits.\n\nThe 'Spar' Bluff: Pretend to be weak to induce a lead, then slam your Ace down on the last trick.",
